/witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Lowered bottom riser and X-over. Installed BOP and hooked up lines. Function tested BOP. Filled lower riser and BOP with MEG using MEG pump and closed upper ram for testing lower riser.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2014-11-25T06:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2014-11-25T06:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- wire line</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Rigged riser from BOP up to drill floor.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2014-11-25T06:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2014-11-25T09:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- wire line</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Rigged up lubricator and hoses on drill floor. Attached sheave wheel in spreader bar in top drive. Lifted up lubraicator.
Meanwhile prepared Halliburton toolstring on drill floor.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2014-11-25T09:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2014-11-25T09:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- wire line</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Performed toolbox talk prior to picking up BHA.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2014-11-25T09:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2014-11-25T11:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Installed BHA#1 7&quot; EV0 plug into lubricator. Stabbed lubricator and tested communication with toolstring.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2014-11-25T11:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2014-11-25T11:20:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- wire line</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Held toolbox talk prior to leak test the R/U.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2014-11-25T11:20:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2014-11-25T12:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Erected barriers for leak testing and got production department to fill riser with MEG using MEG pump. Leak tested R/U to 20/345 bar using Altus pump. Observed leak in the test hose from the pump during low pressure test.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2014-11-25T12:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2014-11-25T12:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Changed hose and continued with leak test.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2014-11-25T12:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2014-11-25T14:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Leak tested R/U and kill wing chicksan manifold to 20/345 bar for 5/10 minutes using 100% MEG. Equalized DHSV using MEG from production system. DHSV equalized and opened at 51 bar. Equalized and opened SV.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2014-11-25T14:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2014-11-25T16:40:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">1000</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>RIH w/BHA #1 (7&quot; EV0 plug) from surface to 1000 m. WHP 51 bar. Observed loss in communication with toolstring. Signal came back again. Continued to RIH. Pick up weights approx. 700 lbs higher than simulated values.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2014-11-25T16:40:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2014-11-25T17:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">1400</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Continued to RIH from 1000 m to 1400 m. Lost commuincation with toolstring. Trouble shooted equipment. Observed communication on and off. Checked surface equipment and trollex. Observed cmmunication falling out when running in hole, but no clear pattern. Decision made to POOH.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2014-11-25T17:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2014-11-25T18:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>POOH w/BHA #1 from 1400 m to surface. WHP 50 bar.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2014-11-25T18:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2014-11-25T20:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Closed SV &amp; HMV and inflow tested same. Purged riser with N2 prior to break lubricator.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2014-11-25T20:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2014-11-25T20:40:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Held Toolbox talk prior to lift L/D BHA#1</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2014-11-25T20:40:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2014-11-25T21:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Broke lubricator and L/D BHA#1.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2014-11-25T21:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2014-11-25T22:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Halliburton checked toolstring components and cablehead. Not able to detect any defects. Decision made to change cablehead and run complete back up string.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2014-11-25T22:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2014-11-26T00:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Re-buildt cable head.
